    "status": "present",
    "value": "All servings are multiples of 25 mL, so measure in units of 25, rounding n up. Let f(a, b) be the answer with a and b units left: f = 0.5 if both are <= 0, 1 if only a is <= 0, 0 if only b is <= 0, otherwise the average of f(a-4, b), f(a-3, b-1), f(a-2, b-2), f(a-1, b-3). Fill a table bottom up. Because A is served 2.5 units per step on average versus 1.5 for B, the answer approaches 1 quickly; once there are 200 or more units it is within 1e-5 of 1, so return 1.0 directly."
  },
