    "status": "present",
    "value": [
      "Can you measure soup in a larger unit than 1 mL?",
      "Define the answer as a function of the remaining amounts of A and B and write its recurrence.",
      "A is consumed faster on average, so for large n the answer tends to 1.",
      "Use units = ceil(n/25), return 1.0 when units >= 200, else fill a units x units table bottom up."
    ]
  },
